From: SF2000 Linux <sf2000@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] qpsx: declare gettimeofday in XA mixer

The uClibc build treats the XA mixer translation unit as a strict C source,
so relying on an include from another source file leaves gettimeofday
undeclared. Include its declaration in the file that uses it.

--- a/src/spu/spu_pcsxrearmed/xa.c
+++ b/src/spu/spu_pcsxrearmed/xa.c
@@ -20,2 +20,3 @@
 #include <stdint.h>
+#include <sys/time.h>
 
